WEBVTT

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:07.300
I'm the Queen of Ice!

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:28.540
I got it!

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:53.160
Yeah

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:29.780
I'm an old man.

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:33.700
Okay! Let's go, Pickles!

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:41.350
I'm going to make bread with Dojin-chan.

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:46.630
It's too late.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:49.740
Um...

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:51.220
What are you doing?

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:53.340
Hurry up and go find the bird's nest!

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:57.420
What? The bird's nest?

00:01:58.540 --> 00:01:59.780
Um... bread...

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:04.060
I'm not going home.

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:06.650
I'm going to study hard.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.300
I hope so, too.

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:20.940
Have a nice summer.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.360
See you soon.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:22.860
Bye.

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:28.600
Did you hear me?

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:29.740
I'll bring you some nice flowers.

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:32.540
I'm in a very cold place, and I don't know where the earth is.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:53.590
Let's meet again!

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:06.420
I don't like it when it's cold.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.600
That's a hamburger kid.

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:13.270
I'm so excited.

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:16.240
You know, it's going to be like this.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:17.220
It's going to be like this.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:22.390
Look at me now.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:23.390
Hamburger Kid

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:38.660
What's wrong with you?

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.780
What's wrong with you?

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:52.920
Queen of the birds?

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:57.320
I'm a bad guy who makes everyone in trouble by bullying weak people.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:59.060
What?

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.220
I'll take that flower back from this hamburger kid.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.060
I'm happy.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.130
I can only tell that the bird's nest lives in a very cold place.

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:16.320
Leave it to me. I'll find it for sure.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.680
Come on, Pinkless!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:21.080
I'm full.

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:25.930
Hehehehehehe.

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:26.350
Thank you for watching!

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:33.250
It's starting to rain.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:38.380
I have one more thing to do!

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:39.060
Pickles!

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:54.400
Ah! Pickles!

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:59.640
Who the hell are you?!

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:07.220
Those who come near my castle will not return alive.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:11.350
I will make you freeze at the moment you take even one step.

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:12.870
Yukio Kano!

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:16.290
That's...

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:27.540
That's...

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:18.410
Let's hurry before the ketchup disappears!

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:20.190
Pickles!

00:06:34.764 --> 00:06:35.444
Get out of here!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:36.160
I see.

00:06:36.204 --> 00:06:38.764
There are the Queen of Ice and the Flower of Ice in there!

00:06:38.764 --> 00:06:40.884
Be careful! Pickles!

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.420
Thank you for watching until the end.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:47.940
I'm glad you came all the way here.

00:06:48.108 --> 00:06:50.108
I won't return it for free!

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:57.980
Where is your flower?

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:03.460
Whoa!

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:06.150
Whoa!

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:06.490
Whoa!

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:36.960
Hm? Is this the Frozen Flower? I finally found it!

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:51.300
It's beautiful! Is this the rumored Frozen Flower?

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:03.060
Are you the Queen of Ice?

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:05.640
Who are you?

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:07.630
What do you want from my castle?

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:10.810
I am the ally of justice, Thunder Girl Kid!

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:14.320
Queen of Ice, give me back the Ice Flower!

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:15.080
What?

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:17.450
You were asked by a girl who stole the Ice Flower!

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:21.130
I'll make you love me!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:23.360
Don't be ridiculous!

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:28.480
The Ice Flower belongs to me!

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:29.840
I'm the one who...

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:45.960
I'll make you regret stepping foot in my castle.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:13.980
I'll let Anpanman know how far you can run.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:26.610
Let's have some ice flowers now.

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:32.950
Oh, oh, oh?

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:38.720
Mr. Bakinman, it's really cold, so please take a rest.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.980
Don't say that.

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:42.470
Don't say that!

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:00.690
What's that?

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:04.080
Pickles, what's wrong with you?

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:05.370
Where's the kit?

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:10.210
Pickles!

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:19.210
I'll melt it for you right away, Pickles.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:21.010
Batako, put more firewood.

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:22.840
I'll do it.

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:30.770
Oh!

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:32.300
I'm glad.

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.380
What's wrong with you?

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:39.520
Did something happen to the hamburger kit?

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:44.980
It's a big deal. Let's go right away.

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:48.770
All right, let's go with Anpanman.

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:54.340
Let me show you.

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.160
I won't let you get away from me!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:40.920
I won't let you get away from me!

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.180
BIKINMAN!

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:44.520
BIKINMAN!

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:53.060
I can't stand the cold!

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:01.550
you

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:20.380
Those who enter my castle will be frozen to death!

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:43.860
This guy is also a snow wolf in my castle.

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:46.330
It's snowing.

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:54.200
I can't go ahead with this.

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:56.780
I'm in trouble.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:03.400
What was that?

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:13.630
That was a snow wolf!

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:40.720
It will freeze at the bottom of the earth!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:55.200
Melonpanna-chan!

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:01.640
What's that?

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:10.800
It's a castle. It's a snow wolf. Maybe...

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:11.080
Wow!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:17.560
Is there a hamburger kit in there, Pickles?

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.170
That's right! Wow!

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.930
Mr. Pickles!

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:21.390
Hmm?

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:32.660
What the hell?

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:03.730
Anpanman?

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:06.410
Yes, let's go, Melonpanna-chan!

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:18.160
Anpanman...

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:20.260
Melonpanna-chan...

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:20.640
Ah!

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:27.370
I'm the Queen of Ice!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.560
How dare you come all the way here!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.680
You're here, Anpanman.

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:39.020
I'm going to bake a hamburger in a hurry.

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:43.660
Oh, oh, there are a lot of customers.

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:46.950
I'll let you pass all of them.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:59.100
Badako, wait a little longer.

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:02.870
Huh?

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:08.930
What are you doing?

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.370
You don't have to do anything useless.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:13.060
Now, it's done!

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:25.960
But I'll make you cry!

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:32.060
I don't want to be fooled by the Baikinman!

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.060
How dare you!

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:36.890
I won't forgive anyone who enters the Ice Castle and approaches the Ice Flower!

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:47.290
Stop it!

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:54.240
Oh, no! It's frozen!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.900
This time, it's Anpanman's face!

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:06.880
It's the same thing no matter how many times I do it!

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:09.040
Everyone will freeze to death!

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:11.850
I'll add it to my collection.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:16.220
Although it's not very beautiful for you guys.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:17.720
Ah!

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:07.700
I'm sorry.

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:08.620
I'm begging you.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:11.020
I'm not going.

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:28.200
I'm going to make you freeze the freshly baked bread.

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:32.760
I won't let you do that!

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:33.600
Here you go!

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:39.400
From now on, I'm going to pour ketchup into the water!

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:00.950
Damn you!

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:03.650
Damn you!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:30.930
Now!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.430
Thank you, Anpanman. It's all thanks to you.

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:17.290
I was saved.

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:19.250
It's all thanks to everyone's help.

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:21.470
I'm glad you're safe.

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:25.980
Oh!

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:36.630
I'll take it!

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:38.540
You're good, Bikinman!

00:20:59.210 --> 00:20:59.490
I'm sorry.
